OL,3,AManhunt after shooting at Swiss rave
OL,4,Akills woman, 22, and injures five
OL,5,
OL,6,FA manhunt is under way after a
OL,7,F22-year-old woman was killed and five
OL,8,Fothers injured in a shooting which
OL,9,Freportedly took place at a rave in
OL,10,Fnorthern Switzerland.
OL,12,FThe woman died at the scene in Aarau,
OL,13,Fpolice said. Those injured were four
OL,14,Fmen and a woman aged between 24 and 27,
OL,15,Fall of whom are in hospital with
OL,16,Finjuries "ranging from minor to
OL,17,Fsevere".
OL,19,FThe force confirmed the shooting
OL,20,Fhappened at an event at a horse racing
OL,21,Ftrack in Aarau, where a rave was taking
OL,22,Fplace into the early hours of Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
