OL,3,AManhunt after shooting at Swiss rave
OL,4,Akills woman, 22, and injures five
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said the perpetrator's identity
OL,7,Fand possible motives were unknown, as
OL,8,Fwere the "exact circumstances" of the
OL,9,Fincident in the town near Zurich.
